{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳一段影片，顯示在深水埗福華街，一輛白色 Tesla 私家車的司機位上坐着一名小童。該名小童雙手不斷左右扭動軚盤；而坐在副駕位置的一名女乘客，期間並未有出手阻止小童的行為。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-03-11h57m28s093.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026fp2W4neyhp1785732452.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-03-11h57m28s093.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">上載影片的網民發文直指行為危險並留言：「燈口玩啲咁嘅嘢，係咪黐線㗎？俾個小朋友坐正司機位操控汽車，仲要係行人紅綠燈口。」影片隨即引起網上熱議，不少網民直指做法離譜，紛紛留言質疑家長及同車成人的做法：「生仔真係要考牌」、「大人唔阻止？」、「好好玩咩？」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-03-11h57m24s167.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026MN2h60pa2A1785732452.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-03-11h57m24s167.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">根據香港法例第 374 章《道路交通條例》第 42 條「駕駛時無執照等」，任何人不得容受或允許並無持有有關車輛所屬種類的駕駛執照的人駕駛汽車。違者如第一次被定罪，最高可處罰款 5,000 元及監禁 3 個月。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T05:18:58.425732+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}